{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghcGo4Az5s9AoqmsD6Dp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added two of the plan items I had dropped, but the swimwear and hair patches are still missing, so \"every plan feature implemented\" does not hold. TASK.md lists no stubs or placeholders, and every feature it describes is in the game; PLAN.md is the larger spec. All 154 checks and the AI Hub harness (2 players) still pass after the change.\n\nAdded this round:\n- **Create + Options combo:** in a hub session, holding Create (pad button 8) now suppresses Start and Pause, as the AI Hub rules require. I never exercised it with a real pad.\n- **Voices slider:** a \"Voices\" slider (default 0.8) is in Settings, and it scales the Animalese voices. I did not build the plan's separate voice audio bus, so it only changes volume per voice blip.\n\nStill missing from the plan:\n- **Swimwear and hair:** no engine swimwear outfit, no new hair or hat styles, and no extras hook. Swimsuits are shirt-outfit colors, and hair uses the engine's five styles.\n- **Extra music options:** the plan's pluck, filter, detune and instrument-table options were not built; the songs use the engine's existing waves.\n- **`touch: 'never'`:** not built; touch-only devices get the Settings touch option turned off and the \"Controller or keyboard required\" gate instead.\n\nUsage remains \"unknown\" because no token or cost figures were exposed to the session. The Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections in my previous reply and in `exit-interview.json` are unchanged and still stand."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1445,"cache_read_input_tokens":414128,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1445},"output_tokens":526,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"